\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces LIME aggregated feature importance (top-30). Latitude, spline\_end\_lon, and longitude lead by a large margin ($>3\times $ the next feature). Fourteen Vedic or semi-Vedic features (including \texttt  {dinamana\_minutes}, \texttt  {vedic\_budha\_full\_degree}, \texttt  {vedic\_guru\_full\_degree}, \texttt  {vedic\_arun\_speed\_deg\_per\_day}) appear in the top-30.}}{16}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
